# 必考词 Unit06
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit06核心词汇

{{label}}{{/ˈleɪbl}}{{n./v. 标签；贴标签；称为}}{{Read the label carefully before taking the medicine.}}
{{lack}}{{/læk}}{{n./v. 缺乏；不足；没有}}{{The project failed due to a lack of funding.}}
{{lag}}{{/læɡ}}{{v./n. 落后；滞后；延迟}}{{The developing country lags behind in technology.}}
{{landscape}}{{/ˈlændskeɪp}}{{n. 风景；景色；形势}}{{The landscape in Guilin is breathtaking.}}
{{launch}}{{/lɔːntʃ}}{{v./n. 发射；启动；推出}}{{The company launched a new smartphone last week.}}
{{layer}}{{/ˈleɪər}}{{n. 层；层次；阶层}}{{The cake has three layers of chocolate.}}
{{lean}}{{/liːn}}{{v./adj. 倾斜；依靠；瘦的；精干的}}{{He leaned against the wall to rest.}}
{{lease}}{{/liːs}}{{n./v. 租约；租借；出租}}{{They signed a three-year lease for the apartment.}}
{{legal}}{{/ˈliːɡl}}{{adj. 法律的；合法的；法定的}}{{It is illegal to drive without a license.}}
{{legislation}}{{/ˌledʒɪsˈleɪʃn}}{{n. 立法；法规；法律}}{{The government passed new legislation on data protection.}}
{{legitimate}}{{/lɪˈdʒɪtɪmət}}{{adj. 合法的；正当的；合理的}}{{The business is legitimate and operates within the law.}}
{{leisure}}{{/ˈleʒər}}{{n. 休闲；空闲；安逸}}{{She spends her leisure time reading and gardening.}}
{{levy}}{{/ˈlevi}}{{v./n. 征收；征税；税款}}{{The government levied a tax on luxury goods.}}
{{liberal}}{{/ˈlɪbərəl}}{{adj. 自由的；开明的；慷慨的}}{{She holds liberal views on social issues.}}
{{liberate}}{{/ˈlɪbəreɪt}}{{v. 解放；释放；使自由}}{{The country was liberated after years of struggle.}}
{{license}}{{/ˈlaɪsns}}{{n. 许可证；执照；特许}}{{You need a license to drive a car.}}
{{likewise}}{{/ˈlaɪkwaɪz}}{{adv. 同样地；也；而且}}{{He is a talented musician, and likewise a great painter.}}
{{limb}}{{/lɪm}}{{n. 肢体；树枝；分支}}{{The monkey swung from limb to limb.}}
{{limit}}{{/ˈlɪmɪt}}{{n./v. 限制；限度；界限}}{{There is a speed limit of 60 km/h in this area.}}
{{link}}{{/lɪŋk}}{{n./v. 链接；联系；连接}}{{The report links smoking to lung cancer.}}
{{literacy}}{{/ˈlɪtərəsi}}{{n. 识字；读写能力；文化素养}}{{The government aims to improve literacy rates.}}
{{literally}}{{/ˈlɪtərəli}}{{adv. 字面上；确实；简直}}{{He literally ran all the way to school.}}
{{literary}}{{/ˈlɪtərəri}}{{adj. 文学的；书面的；文人的}}{{She has a deep love for English literary works.}}
{{literature}}{{/ˈlɪtrətʃər}}{{n. 文学；文献；著作}}{{She has a deep love for English literature.}}
{{locate}}{{/ləʊˈkeɪt}}{{v. 位于；找到；定位}}{{The hotel is located near the beach.}}
{{logical}}{{/ˈlɒdʒɪkl}}{{adj. 逻辑的；合理的；必然的}}{{Your argument is logical and well-supported.}}
{{loom}}{{/luːm}}{{v./n. 隐约出现；逼近；织布机}}{{A crisis looms on the horizon.}}
{{maintain}}{{/meɪnˈteɪn}}{{v. 维持；保养；主张；坚持}}{{It is important to maintain a healthy lifestyle.}}
{{major}}{{/ˈmeɪdʒər}}{{adj./n. 主要的；专业；主修}}{{Education is a major concern for parents.}}
{{majority}}{{/məˈdʒɒrəti}}{{n. 多数；大多数；成年}}{{The majority of students voted for the proposal.}}
{{manage}}{{/ˈmænɪdʒ}}{{v. 管理；设法；应付}}{{She manages a team of 30 employees.}}
{{manifest}}{{/ˈmænɪfest}}{{v./adj. 表明；显示；明显的}}{{His talent manifested itself at an early age.}}
{{manipulate}}{{/məˈnɪpjuleɪt}}{{v. 操纵；操作；篡改}}{{The company was accused of manipulating stock prices.}}
{{manner}}{{/ˈmænər}}{{n. 方式；礼貌；风格}}{{She spoke in a polite manner.}}
{{manual}}{{/ˈmænjuəl}}{{adj./n. 手工的；手册；说明书}}{{Please read the instruction manual before using the device.}}
{{manufacture}}{{/ˌmænjuˈfæktʃər}}{{v./n. 制造；生产；制造业}}{{The factory manufactures electronic components.}}
{{margin}}{{/ˈmɑːdʒɪn}}{{n. 边缘；利润；余地；页边}}{{The company operates on a narrow margin.}}
{{marine}}{{/məˈriːn}}{{adj./n. 海洋的；海军的；海运的}}{{Marine pollution is a serious environmental problem.}}
{{mass}}{{/mæs}}{{n./adj. 大量；群众的；大规模的}}{{A mass of people gathered in the square.}}
{{massive}}{{/ˈmæsɪv}}{{adj. 巨大的；大规模的；结实的}}{{The earthquake caused massive destruction.}}
{{mature}}{{/məˈtʃʊər}}{{adj./v. 成熟的；使成熟；到期的}}{{She is very mature for her age.}}
{{maximize}}{{/ˈmæksɪmaɪz}}{{v. 使最大化；充分利用}}{{The company aims to maximize profits.}}
{{mechanism}}{{/ˈmekənɪzəm}}{{n. 机制；机械装置；方法}}{{The clock has a complex mechanism.}}
{{media}}{{/ˈmiːdiə}}{{n. 媒体；媒介；介质}}{{Social media has changed the way we communicate.}}
{{mediate}}{{/ˈmiːdieɪt}}{{v. 调解；斡旋；居中促成}}{{The UN mediated between the two countries.}}
{{medieval}}{{/ˌmediˈiːvl}}{{adj. 中世纪的；古老的}}{{The town has a well-preserved medieval castle.}}
{{memo}}{{/ˈmeməʊ}}{{n. 备忘录；便笺}}{{The manager sent a memo to all employees.}}
{{mental}}{{/ˈmentl}}{{adj. 精神的；心理的；智力的}}{{Mental health is as important as physical health.}}
{{mentor}}{{/ˈmentɔːr}}{{n./v. 导师；指导者；指导}}{{She has been a mentor to many young scientists.}}
{{merchant}}{{/ˈmɜːtʃənt}}{{n. 商人；零售商}}{{The merchant sold goods from all over the world.}}
{{mercy}}{{/ˈmɜːsi}}{{n. 仁慈；怜悯；幸运}}{{The judge showed mercy to the first-time offender.}}
{{merge}}{{/mɜːdʒ}}{{v. 合并；融合；兼并}}{{The two companies merged to form a larger corporation.}}
{{merit}}{{/ˈmerɪt}}{{n./v. 优点；价值；值得}}{{The plan has considerable merit.}}
{{method}}{{/ˈmeθəd}}{{n. 方法；办法；条理}}{{We need to find a more efficient method.}}
{{migrate}}{{/maɪˈɡreɪt}}{{v. 迁移；移居；迁徙}}{{Many birds migrate south in winter.}}
{{military}}{{/ˈmɪlɪtəri}}{{adj./n. 军事的；军队；军方}}{{The country increased its military spending.}}
{{minister}}{{/ˈmɪnɪstər}}{{n. 部长；牧师；外交使节}}{{The prime minister addressed the nation.}}
{{minor}}{{/ˈmaɪnər}}{{adj./n. 次要的；未成年人；辅修}}{{The problem is minor and can be easily fixed.}}
{{minority}}{{/maɪˈnɒrəti}}{{n. 少数；少数民族；未成年}}{{The rights of minorities should be protected.}}
{{miracle}}{{/ˈmɪrəkl}}{{n. 奇迹；令人惊奇的事}}{{It was a miracle that no one was hurt in the accident.}}
{{mislead}}{{/ˌmɪsˈliːd}}{{v. 误导；欺骗；使误入歧途}}{{The advertisement was designed to mislead consumers.}}
{{mission}}{{/ˈmɪʃn}}{{n. 使命；任务；代表团；传教}}{{The mission to Mars was a great success.}}
{{mobile}}{{/ˈməʊbaɪl}}{{adj./n. 移动的；手机；可动物}}{{Mobile phones have become an essential part of daily life.}}
{{moderate}}{{/ˈmɒdərət}}{{adj./v. 适度的；温和的；缓和}}{{Moderate exercise is beneficial to health.}}
{{modify}}{{/ˈmɒdɪfaɪ}}{{v. 修改；改变；修饰}}{{We need to modify the plan to fit the new requirements.}}
{{momentum}}{{/məˈmentəm}}{{n. 动力；势头；动量}}{{The reform movement gained momentum.}}
{{monitor}}{{/ˈmɒnɪtər}}{{n./v. 监视器；监控；班长}}{{Doctors monitor the patient's condition closely.}}
{{monopoly}}{{/məˈnɒpəli}}{{n. 垄断；专卖；独占}}{{The company has a monopoly on the market.}}
{{moral}}{{/ˈmɒrəl}}{{adj./n. 道德的；寓意；品行}}{{The story has a strong moral lesson.}}
{{moreover}}{{/mɔːrˈəʊvər}}{{adv. 此外；而且；再者}}{{The plan is feasible; moreover, it is cost-effective.}}
{{mortgage}}{{/ˈmɔːɡɪdʒ}}{{n./v. 抵押；按揭；抵押贷款}}{{They took out a mortgage to buy their first home.}}
{{motivate}}{{/ˈməʊtɪveɪt}}{{v. 激励；激发；促动}}{{Good teachers motivate students to learn.}}
{{motive}}{{/ˈməʊtɪv}}{{n. 动机；目的；主旨}}{{The police are investigating the motive for the crime.}}
{{multiple}}{{/ˈmʌltɪpl}}{{adj. 多重的；多个的；多样的}}{{The test has multiple-choice questions.}}
{{multitude}}{{/ˈmʌltɪtjuːd}}{{n. 大量；众多；群众}}{{A multitude of problems arose during the project.}}
{{mutual}}{{/ˈmjuːtʃuəl}}{{adj. 相互的；共同的；彼此的}}{{They have a mutual respect for each other.}}
